{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP"]]},"metadata":{"title":"WordNet Semantic Hierarchy & Lexical Graphs","roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"SwiftNLP"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"title":"WordNet Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/WordNet","doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/Synset"],"anchor":"WordNet-Types"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/WordNetAndLexicalGraphs","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Navigate semantic relationships, compute synset distances, and explore English hypernym\/hyponym trees.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftnlp\/wordnetandlexicalgraphs"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WordNet"},{"type":"text","text":" is a large lexical database of English where nouns, verbs, adjectives, and adverbs are organized into sets of cognitive synonyms called "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Synsets"}]},{"type":"text","text":", interlinked by conceptual-semantic and lexical relations."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"1. Looking Up Synsets & Definitions","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"1-Looking-Up-Synsets--Definitions"},{"code":["import SwiftNLP","","let wordnet = WordNet.shared","","\/\/ Look up all noun synsets for \"bank\"","let synsets = wordnet.synsets(for: \"bank\", pos: .noun)","for s in synsets {","    print(\"ID: \\(s.id), Definition: \\(s.definition)\")","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"2. Semantic Similarity Metrics","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"2-Semantic-Similarity-Metrics"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftSci implements standard lexical similarity algorithms:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Path Similarity"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Shortest path distance in the hypernym taxonomy:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"$$\\text{Sim}_{\\text{path}}(s_1, s_2) = \\frac{1}{1 + \\text{distance}(s_1, s_2)}$$"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wu-Palmer Similarity (WUP)"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Measures depth of least common subsumer (LCS) relative to synset depths:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"$$\\text{Sim}_{\\text{wup}}(s_1, s_2) = \\frac{2 \\cdot \\text{depth}(\\text{LCS})}{\\text{depth}(s_1) + \\text{depth}(s_2)}$$"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let dog = wordnet.synset(\"dog.n.01\")!","let cat = wordnet.synset(\"cat.n.01\")!","","let pathSim = wordnet.pathSimilarity(dog, cat)","let wupSim = wordnet.wuPalmerSimilarity(dog, cat)","","print(\"Path Similarity: \\(pathSim), Wu-Palmer: \\(wupSim)\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"kind":"article","references":{"doc://SwiftNLP/documentation/SwiftNLP/Synset":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Synset"}],"title":"Synset","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Synset"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/Synset","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Represents a WordNet Synset (Syntactic\/Semantic Set of Synonym Concepts)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftnlp\/synset","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiftNLP/documentation/SwiftNLP":{"title":"SwiftNLP","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Natural Language Processing, Text Feature Extraction & Native Apple NaturalLanguage Integration."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftnlp","role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiftNLP/documentation/SwiftNLP/WordNet":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WordNet"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftNLP\/documentation\/SwiftNLP\/WordNet","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"WordNet"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftnlp\/wordnet","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Native WordNet semantic database query engine and concept similarity computer."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"WordNet"}}}